      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Headaches are extremely common and have various causes. Drugs may initiate a new type of headache or exacerbate a preexisting headache disorder. Medication withdrawal or rebound headaches may also occur. This article reviews the possible relationships between drugs and headaches."},
